 used pyOpenSSL directly. Use the crypto caller of ceph.cryptotools instead,
 as Tentacle does (https://github.com/ceph/ceph/pull/66794), but keep Squid's
 function names and return values, so that the callers stay unchanged.
Ceph-Version: >= 19.2.5
